feedback or reviews? We also are open to other recommendations for a TA proficient with destination weddings in Mexico.&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":336497,"PostDate":1213211097,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <font face=\"Franklin Gothic Medium\"><font color=\"RoyalBlue\">I was wondering if anyone has or is using destinantionweddings.com as their travel agency? I need a travel agent (like yesterday!!), and I thinking of using them. Anyone have feedback or reviews? We also are open to other recommendations for a TA proficient with destination weddings in Mexico.<\/font><\/font>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinktokyo@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1212119365,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209652.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Krose82","Id":209652,"Name":"Krose82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":10900,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca2bd5a8ab43f3892be17817e106fd09","RawContent":"Try checking these threads out ...\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t21957\"&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t21957&lt;\/a&gt;\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t2213\"&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t2213&lt;\/a&gt;\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t20670\"&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t20670&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n ... or this one: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t10706\"&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t10706&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":336519,"PostDate":1213211995,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Try checking these threads out ...<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t21957' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati...om\/forum\/t21957<\/a><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t2213' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati...com\/forum\/t2213<\/a><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t20670' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati...om\/forum\/t20670<\/a><br \/> <br \/> ... or this one: <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t10706' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati...om\/forum\/t10706<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/anns-annr-las-caletas-dreams-pv-hawaii-review-looooooong-6068\/'>Ann's Caletas Wedding & Hawaii Honeymoon Review<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.leighmillerphotography.com\/darkroom\/share\/?n=ann_paul'>Our Caletas Wedding Slideshow (by Leigh Miller)<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.onetruemedia.com\/shared?p=31de360c85cec8376c35a5&skin_id=701&utm_source=otm&utm_medium=image'>Our Caletas Wedding Video<\/a>","Email":"annkherrick@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.16.7.43","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1161392880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206863.jpg?_r=1429384252","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LCBride2007","Id":206863,"Name":"LCBride2007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":10900,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ede22b72090693d6cd8c8afc6690272a","RawContent":"Hi ladies my date is a little over a year away but I want to start looking into travel agency&#039;s to help my guests. I am sending my STDs in July. Has anyone ever used Destinationweddings.com? Or does anyone have a travel agency they&#039;d like to recommend? I&#039;m based out of NYC. Thanks","Attachments":[],"Id":704197,"PostDate":1243465369,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies my date is a little over a year away but I want to start looking into travel agency's to help my guests. I am sending my STDs in July. Has anyone ever used Destinationweddings.com? Or does anyone have a travel agency they'd like to recommend? I'm based out of NYC. Thanks\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>65 BOOKED PLUS BRIDE & GROOM<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt22b9e.aspx\">http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt22b9e.aspx<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"dmvega@optimum.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1238128946,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216200.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":99,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"damaris","Id":216200,"Name":"damaris","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":10900,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"68d2f6bc9e5424150d3eb699034f5a76","RawContent":"i have not used that site, but you may want to try a search and see if any of the other girls have.\n \n also, in case you weren&#039;t aware there are some wonderful BDW ladies (see the brightly colored banner at the very top of the page) that are TAs for specific regions and they may be able to help you as well! good luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":704202,"PostDate":1243465521,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                i have not used that site, but you may want to try a search and see if any of the other girls have.<br \/> <br \/> also, in case you weren't aware there are some wonderful BDW ladies (see the brightly colored banner at the very top of the page) that are TAs for specific regions and they may be able to help you as well! good luck!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i721.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww211\/ebredhawk\/ejttd_0008.jpg\">http:\/\/i721.photobucket.com\/albums\/w...ejttd_0008.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/blog.eyespy-weddings.com\/\">eyespy photography<\/a><br><br><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/dreams-punta-cana-la-barcaza-review-4-28-10-super-long-58714\">my Dreams Punta Cana\/La Barcaza review<\/a><\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ebredhawk@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1234834018,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214967.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ebredhawk","Id":214967,"Name":"ebredhawk","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":10900,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"213d76566d5cbe98f36ced04b8e65987","RawContent":"Thank you so much for the quick responses. I will definetely reach out to Jill&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":704213,"PostDate":1243465947,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you so much for the quick responses. I will definetely reach out to Jill<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>65 BOOKED PLUS BRIDE & GROOM<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt22b9e.aspx\">http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tools\/tickers\/tt22b9e.aspx<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"dmvega@optimum.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1238128946,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216200.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":99,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"damaris","Id":216200,"Name":"damaris","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":10900,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba8273012ddaded12bf9e27506a9cc54","RawContent":"I&#039;m using destinationweddings.com and love my TA....but I got reassigned to her. The first person they assigned me to was not helpful at all!! She was kinda flaky and all over the board..........but I LOVE THE NEW TA.\n \n If I&#039;d have known about BDW I probably would have used someone from this site, cuz i love it so much....but I&#039;d already done destinationweddings.com\n \n Good Luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":704245,"PostDate":1243467730,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm using destinationweddings.com and love my TA....but I got reassigned to her. The first person they assigned me to was not helpful at all!! She was kinda flaky and all over the board..........but I LOVE THE NEW TA.<br \/> <br \/> If I'd have known about BDW I probably would have used someone from this site, cuz i love it so much....but I'd already done destinationweddings.com<br \/> <br \/> Good Luck!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>11.28.2009<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jmcharlton@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1235099558,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215075.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JOSIE","Id":215075,"Name":"JOSIE","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDelete