th Jill, the BDW TA...but that&#039;s entirely because I&#039;m slow with my responses. She&#039;s been great so far, although I haven&#039;t used her services to the full extent. This thread actually reminded me to contact her regarding booking hotel\/flights together. Wonder if that is better than booking them separately. Anyhoo..I should search through other threads to find my answer, i guess.","Attachments":[],"Id":723460,"PostDate":1245058300,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I've had sporadic contact with Jill, the BDW TA...but that's entirely because I'm slow with my responses. She's been great so far, although I haven't used her services to the full extent. This thread actually reminded me to contact her regarding booking hotel\/flights together. Wonder if that is better than booking them separately. Anyhoo..I should search through other threads to find my answer, i guess.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"loanmao@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1220945204,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211647.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":48,"PhotoHeight":48,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"loanmao","Id":211647,"Name":"loanmao","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":10900,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"35b95d095882e7870300c202e77b9af8","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;loanmao&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I&#039;ve had sporadic contact with Jill, the BDW TA...but that&#039;s entirely because I&#039;m slow with my responses. She&#039;s been great so far, although I haven&#039;t used her services to the full extent. This thread actually reminded me to contact her regarding booking hotel\/flights together. Wonder if that is better than booking them separately. Anyhoo..I should search through other threads to find my answer, i guess.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I&#039;m looking into Play del Carmen and would also be working with Jill. She sent me the initial information last week and it seems very thorough. Has she been able to provide some good quotes on hotel\/airfare? Was she able to help you narrow down your search?","Attachments":[],"Id":723474,"PostDate":1245062208,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>loanmao<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I've had sporadic contact with Jill, the BDW TA...but that's entirely because I'm slow with my responses. She's been great so far, although I haven't used her services to the full extent. This thread actually reminded me to contact her regarding booking hotel\/flights together. Wonder if that is better than booking them separately. Anyhoo..I should search through other threads to find my answer, i guess.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I'm looking into Play del Carmen and would also be working with Jill. She sent me the initial information last week and it seems very thorough. Has she been able to provide some good quotes on hotel\/airfare? Was she able to help you narrow down your search?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenniwinston@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1242380407,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217572.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SDbeachgirl","Id":217572,"Name":"SDbeachgirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":10900,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46bbcd840553aa536b149bfc82619275","RawContent":"My TA with destinationweddings.com has been TERRIBLE! What a waste of time!","Attachments":[],"Id":723609,"PostDate":1245087850,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My TA with destinationweddings.com has been TERRIBLE! What a waste of time!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>My Secrets Maroma Beach Wedding Review<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/secrets-maroma-beach-review-7-11-2009-a-46502\/?highlight=secrets+maroma+beach\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...s+maroma+beach<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sam6156@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1222622354,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211993.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"newyork6156","Id":211993,"Name":"newyork6156","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":10900,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ad9260c60310207b93804af9a9d5325","RawContent":"I&#039;m currently using destination weddings and it has been kind of interesting..I&#039;m on my \n 3rd coordinator the first one just didnt listen to what I wanted the 2nd got sick, so far the 3rd Nancy has been helpfull...but like someone else posted (probably not about her) she is all over the board and chatty and I have to rangle the conversation to get what I need out of it. Overall I would rather have a coordinator than not, but I&#039;m not sure I would choose this company again...","Attachments":[],"Id":735043,"PostDate":1245817556,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm currently using destination weddings and it has been kind of interesting..I'm on my <br \/> 3rd coordinator the first one just didnt listen to what I wanted the 2nd got sick, so far the 3rd Nancy has been helpfull...but like someone else posted (probably not about her) she is all over the board and chatty and I have to rangle the conversation to get what I need out of it. Overall I would rather have a coordinator than not, but I'm not sure I would choose this company again...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/1768\/20100522\/Until+I+Marry+My+Love\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/...ove\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tracihopeis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238572485,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216339.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"thope","Id":216339,"Name":"thope","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":10900,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"86d28262fe30ddbcd0a5b8dfa5570e47","RawContent":"I&#039;m using them, but also have been having a so-so experience with them. It was the 1st post engagement thing we purchased and I wish I had of done more research first.\n \n I don&#039;t think I&#039;ll actually be booking with them, but it sucks to lose our deposit &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; Our TA has given us what we thought was some good advice and then we hear the contrary from other TA&#039;s, so it&#039;s confusing. She&#039;s pretty flaky and seems to forget about us... she was supposed to get back to me 2 weeks ago with pricing for next April. \n \n I wish I had found this website before finding theirs...","Attachments":[],"Id":735128,"PostDate":1245820152,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm using them, but also have been having a so-so experience with them. It was the 1st post engagement thing we purchased and I wish I had of done more research first.<br \/> <br \/> I don't think I'll actually be booking with them, but it sucks to lose our deposit <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> Our TA has given us what we thought was some good advice and then we hear the contrary from other TA's, so it's confusing. She's pretty flaky and seems to forget about us... she was supposed to get back to me 2 weeks ago with pricing for next April. <br \/> <br \/> I wish I had found this website before finding theirs...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span><p class='bbc_center'><\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/ourwedding\/AmyWalter&RoySquire\">http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/ourwedding\/AmyWalter&RoySquire<\/a><span><\/p><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10719;116\/st\/20100428\/e\/Our+Wedding+in+Paradise%21\/k\/ba76\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...ba76\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"amygirl1169@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1244355104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218196.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":71,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amygirl1169","Id":218196,"Name":"amygirl1169","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":209,"TotalPages":21,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":200},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
