\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.255.224.56","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78276,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"04de29e71938d0fc8d56de6a0cb4d33f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;April 9, 2016 at Now Larimar in Punta Cana!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891776,"PostDate":1428076778,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>April 9, 2016 at Now Larimar in Punta Cana!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashley225@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.117.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426945785,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282492.jpg?_r=1450918742","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AshleyNYC323","Id":282492,"Name":"AshleyNYC323","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"167.57.147.163","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78276,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1428271971,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1eba486e0702451a240cf4523b219a4d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi girls! We have confirmed July 9th 2016 at Gran Caribe Real Canc\u00fan.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m so nervous and I keep telling myself we still have over a year to plan! Yet, I want to start everything!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;When are you planning to send your stds? Since half of the family is traveling, I was thinking about sending them with one year anticipation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891907,"PostDate":1428271957,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi girls! We have confirmed July 9th 2016 at Gran Caribe Real Canc\u00fan.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm so nervous and I keep telling myself we still have over a year to plan! Yet, I want to start everything!!!<\/p>\n<p>When are you planning to send your stds? Since half of the family is traveling, I was thinking about sending them with one year anticipation.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"glenrosado@gmail.com","IpAddress":"152.156.246.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423176435,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282015.jpg?_r=1428272293","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":170,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GlenRosa90","Id":282015,"Name":"GlenRosa90","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.147.118.47","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78276,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d977c48224fb714b6aad53e5c24e9cce","RawContent":"@[member=\"GlenRosa90\"] congrats! I ordered my STDs and they should arrive this week. I&#039;m sending them out ASAP for our June 7th, 2016 wedding :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1891930,"PostDate":1428280333,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282015\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282015-glenrosa90\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">GlenRosa90<\/span><\/a> congrats! I ordered my STDs and they should arrive this week. I'm sending them out ASAP for our June 7th, 2016 wedding <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Ashley<br><br>My Planning Thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/<\/a><br>\u00a0<\/p><div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div><div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160607\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ecf1\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div><div><\/a><\/div>","Email":"ashley.taylor@live.ca","IpAddress":"184.147.135.4","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1423105061,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.jpg?_r=1451447049","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":210,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashhtayy","Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"167.57.147.163","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78276,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0195eaa9d8b9ee833cbe076f270f2a97","RawContent":"[quote name=\"ashhtayy\" post=\"1891930\" timestamp=\"1428280333\"]\n@[member=\"GlenRosa90\"] congrats! I ordered my STDs and they should arrive this week. I&#039;m sending them out ASAP for our June 7th, 2016 wedding :)[\/quote]Awesome! I don&#039;t know if I&#039;m doing them myself or ordering online. Shippings to Uruguay are a bit over the top! \nAnyways congrats to you too!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1891944,"PostDate":1428291786,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>ashhtayy, on 05 April 2015 - 04:32 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282015\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282015-glenrosa90\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">GlenRosa90<\/span><\/a> congrats! I ordered my STDs and they should arrive this week. I'm sending them out ASAP for our June 7th, 2016 wedding <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Awesome! I don't know if I'm doing them myself or ordering online. Shippings to Uruguay are a bit over the top!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyways congrats to you too!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"glenrosado@gmail.com","IpAddress":"152.156.246.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423176435,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282015.jpg?_r=1428272293","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":170,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GlenRosa90","Id":282015,"Name":"GlenRosa90","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.147.118.47","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78276,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"94be8e20f539350724bd288f261b1b0c","RawContent":"I would have loved to make mine - homemade cards are my favourite. Unfortunately (or fortunately!) we had to act fast to secure our deal.\n\n\nI&#039;ll do a lot of DIY projects for the actual wedding though. I&#039;m too excited to start the fun stuff.","Attachments":[],"Id":1891948,"PostDate":1428293827,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I would have loved to make mine - homemade cards are my favourite. Unfortunately (or fortunately!) we had to act fast to secure our deal.<br><br>\nI'll do a lot of DIY projects for the actual wedding though. I'm too excited to start the fun stuff. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Ashley<br><br>My Planning Thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/<\/a><br>\u00a0<\/p><div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div><div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160607\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ecf1\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div><div><\/a><\/div>","Email":"ashley.taylor@live.ca","IpAddress":"184.147.135.4","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1423105061,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.jpg?_r=1451447049","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":210,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashhtayy","Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"167.57.155.176","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78276,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"710a436000f28f1df1896dc0b9a322c2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I loooove DIY, I wish I had more time to sit and actually make stuff (so far my \"DIY\" is pinned hahaha) but I do plan on taking many things done by myself.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have you thought about welcome bags?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892092,"PostDate":1428372662,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I loooove DIY, I wish I had more time to sit and actually make stuff (so far my \"DIY\" is pinned hahaha) but I do plan on taking many things done by myself.<\/p>\n<p>Have you thought about welcome bags?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"glenrosado@gmail.com","IpAddress":"152.156.246.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423176435,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282015.jpg?_r=1428272293","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":170,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GlenRosa90","Id":282015,"Name":"GlenRosa90","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.202.4.77","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78276,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c34997c3c56be4f2f0bb3b1741007671","RawContent":"Hi Ladies! \n\n\nWe have chosen Moon Palace for 26th April 2016! \n\n\nWe are doing boarding pass STD&#039;s. Had a friend design them for us, got them back last week. Just finalising the guest list so we can send them out...hoping to have them with guests before 26th April so they have them a year in advance \ud83d\ude0a","Attachments":[],"Id":1892454,"PostDate":1428564320,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Ladies! <br><br>\nWe have chosen Moon Palace for 26th April 2016! <br><br>\nWe are doing boarding pass STD's. Had a friend design them for us, got them back last week. Just finalising the guest list so we can send them out...hoping to have them with guests before 26th April so they have them a year in advance \ud83d\ude0a\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ricardoandkershia@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"82.16.59.180","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420514404,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SunshineDreamKay","Id":281615,"Name":"SunshineDreamKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.147.118.47","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78276,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ddeb07e59d7408a553b2e0a037881b0a","RawContent":"@[member=\"GlenRosa90\"] I&#039;ve thought about them...still not sure if we will do it though. I have in my mind i&#039;d rather do tank tops for everyone. \n\n\nWhat are you thinking?","Attachments":[],"Id":1892457,"PostDate":1428572339,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282015\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282015-glenrosa90\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">GlenRosa90<\/span><\/a> I've thought about them...still not sure if we will do it though. I have in my mind i'd rather do tank tops for everyone. <br><br>\nWhat are you thinking?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Ashley<br><br>My Planning Thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/<\/a><br>\u00a0<\/p><div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div><div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160607\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ecf1\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div><div><\/a><\/div>","Email":"ashley.taylor@live.ca","IpAddress":"184.147.135.4","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1423105061,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.jpg?_r=1451447049","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":210,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashhtayy","Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"128.100.41.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78276,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ec9afe566975a3af5f5382e39265fcf7","RawContent":"[quote name=\"krystalball\" post=\"1890928\" timestamp=\"1427403974\"]\nApril 9, 2016 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya\n\nJust sent out the invites so people can put down deposits and bought my wedding dress on the weekend. I feel like I did all the important stuff super early and now I have over a year of waiting - and I&#039;m not a very patient person![\/quote]I understand your pain....I&#039;m not a patient person either! :) \n\nWhere did you buy your wedding dress? My parents and I are going to be doing that in June and I&#039;m looking for recommendations on stores. Also, did you go with a typical wedding dress or a lighter one due to the heat in Mexico?","Attachments":[],"Id":1893715,"PostDate":1429548879,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>krystalball, on 26 March 2015 - 01:06 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>April 9, 2016 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just sent out the invites so people can put down deposits and bought my wedding dress on the weekend. I feel like I did all the important stuff super early and now I have over a year of waiting - and I'm not a very patient person!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I understand your pain....I'm not a patient person either! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Where did you buy your wedding dress? My parents and I are going to be doing that in June and I'm looking for recommendations on stores. Also, did you go with a typical wedding dress or a lighter one due to the heat in Mexico?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"robynb7@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.233.112.15","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1409889393,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279694.jpg?_r=1425843817","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":171,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rbehlke","Id":279694,"Name":"rbehlke","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":78,"TotalPages":8,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":70},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
