Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.211.59.236","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"feba2e24408a3c4e8b1e631f73915b2f","RawContent":"Sorry guys....i thought I was following this thread but I guess not. It&#039;s nice @[member=\"puravida2015\"] and @[member=\"Laks86\"] will be at the resort the same week hopefully we can arrange a hook up. Our group flies down on April 13-20. I just hired a photographer &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/elvelophotography.smallfolio.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/elvelophotography.smallfolio.com\/&lt;\/a&gt; they come highly recommended. If you&#039;re interested I can give you the contact information of the coordinator I am using. I had a glance at the photography rates at the resort and the prices are ridiculous for amateur resort photography.","Attachments":[],"Id":1870024,"PostDate":1409587233,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Sorry guys....i thought I was following this thread but I guess not. It's nice @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279580\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279580-puravida2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">puravida2015<\/span><\/a> and @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279365\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279365-laks86\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Laks86<\/span><\/a> will be at the resort the same week hopefully we can arrange a hook up. Our group flies down on April 13-20. I just hired a photographer <a href='http:\/\/elvelophotography.smallfolio.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/elvelophotogr...smallfolio.com\/<\/a> they come highly recommended. If you're interested I can give you the contact information of the coordinator I am using. I had a glance at the photography rates at the resort and the prices are ridiculous for amateur resort photography.  \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tammy.jacobs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.211.99.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405957765,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279107.jpg?_r=1408932832","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"projecttwayne2015","Id":279107,"Name":"projecttwayne2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"8.10.80.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"052f6fabf06cc50e01ba3f1d181b63c9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you @[member=\"projecttwayne2015\"]. Our party will be there the same dates. I will message you regarding the the photography.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1870209,"PostDate":1409676352,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279107\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279107-projecttwayne2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">projecttwayne2015<\/span><\/a>. Our party will be there the same dates. I will message you regarding the the photography.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409091107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"141.155.175.28","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8bdf8578328196e9adf718e7b7ba875b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I purchased the package that comes with some photos... Im wondering if I should choose a different package.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Which package did you guys sign up for... I got the ultimate one i think...&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Anyone have any updates?&amp;nbsp; Hear anything new lately... im getting antsy...lol...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1871689,"PostDate":1410632369,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I purchased the package that comes with some photos... Im wondering if I should choose a different package.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Which package did you guys sign up for... I got the ultimate one i think...<\/p>\n<br \/><p>Anyone have any updates?\u00a0 Hear anything new lately... im getting antsy...lol...<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"idawhite@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.167.189.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407500627,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279359.jpg?_r=1407595489","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":163,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bkprettygirl","Id":279359,"Name":"bkprettygirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"8.10.80.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ff49068c90cad2e8da0e247afae1151b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;The Dreams of Love and Ultimate both come with photos. It&#039;s probably better to get one of those packages instead of the Paradise package because by the time you add in all the other extras you&#039;ll end up paying the same amount. But not really sure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We selected the Ultimate package as well. Haven&#039;t really heard many updates but looks like they added a couple of room pictures on website.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Today is CR Independence Day so don&#039;t expect much response from anyone! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1871881,"PostDate":1410807691,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>The Dreams of Love and Ultimate both come with photos. It's probably better to get one of those packages instead of the Paradise package because by the time you add in all the other extras you'll end up paying the same amount. But not really sure.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We selected the Ultimate package as well. Haven't really heard many updates but looks like they added a couple of room pictures on website.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Today is CR Independence Day so don't expect much response from anyone! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409091107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.183.217.24","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"483ff451af0da1f563c78d445ec5f978","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello lovelies! We are going Dreams Las Mareas in 2015 as well. Hoping to get in a little later in April around the 25th. Does anyone have any pricing information regarding additional guests etc? If so I would love any info you have &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:britt_k5@Hotmail.com&#039;&gt;britt_k5@Hotmail.com&lt;\/a&gt;. Thanks so much!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872133,"PostDate":1410989438,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello lovelies! We are going Dreams Las Mareas in 2015 as well. Hoping to get in a little later in April around the 25th. Does anyone have any pricing information regarding additional guests etc? If so I would love any info you have <a href='mailto:britt_k5@Hotmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>britt_k5@Hotmail.com<\/a>. Thanks so much!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"britt_k5@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.173.33.31","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410958328,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jengak5","Id":279872,"Name":"jengak5","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"141.155.175.28","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"333acb65d8b0caed0abd85e6bd5a77a1","RawContent":"I think its 85 additional per person for the ultimate package ..\n\n75 per person for the love package\n\nand im not sure about the first one....\n\nI know I read it somewhere but im not 100% sure...\n\nIm already at 56 people so im 36 over (OMG!...lol)\n\n[quote name=\"jengak5\" post=\"1872133\" timestamp=\"1410989438\"]\nHello lovelies! We are going Dreams Las Mareas in 2015 as well. Hoping to get in a little later in April around the 25th. Does anyone have any pricing information regarding additional guests etc? If so I would love any info you have [email=\"britt_k5@Hotmail.com\"]britt_k5@Hotmail.com[\/email]. Thanks so much![\/quote]\nThey still havent taken my deposit... im sooooooo nervous! \n[quote name=\"puravida2015\" post=\"1871881\" timestamp=\"1410807691\"]\nThe Dreams of Love and Ultimate both come with photos. It&#039;s probably better to get one of those packages instead of the Paradise package because by the time you add in all the other extras you&#039;ll end up paying the same amount. But not really sure. \n\nWe selected the Ultimate package as well. Haven&#039;t really heard many updates but looks like they added a couple of room pictures on website. \n\nToday is CR Independence Day so don&#039;t expect much response from anyone! :)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1872374,"PostDate":1411162565,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think its 85 additional per person for the ultimate package ..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>75 per person for the love package<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>and im not sure about the first one....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know I read it somewhere but im not 100% sure...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Im already at 56 people so im 36 over (OMG!...lol)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jengak5, on 17 September 2014 - 01:30 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello lovelies! We are going Dreams Las Mareas in 2015 as well. Hoping to get in a little later in April around the 25th. Does anyone have any pricing information regarding additional guests etc? If so I would love any info you have <a href='mailto:britt_k5@Hotmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>britt_k5@Hotmail.com<\/a>. Thanks so much!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><br \/><p>They still havent taken my deposit... im sooooooo nervous!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>puravida2015, on 15 September 2014 - 11:01 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>The Dreams of Love and Ultimate both come with photos. It's probably better to get one of those packages instead of the Paradise package because by the time you add in all the other extras you'll end up paying the same amount. But not really sure.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We selected the Ultimate package as well. Haven't really heard many updates but looks like they added a couple of room pictures on website.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Today is CR Independence Day so don't expect much response from anyone! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"idawhite@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.167.189.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407500627,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279359.jpg?_r=1407595489","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":163,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bkprettygirl","Id":279359,"Name":"bkprettygirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.227.239.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"162a357463ecbe10f990479e9e9ba3f9","RawContent":"@[member=\"bkprettygirl\"], I have not been able to get a response from anyone at the resort in the past couple of weeks. I understand that their response my be slow since their still preparing for their opening but I&#039;m getting nervous as well. Who were working with to secure your date?","Attachments":[],"Id":1872380,"PostDate":1411166683,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279359\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279359-bkprettygirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">bkprettygirl<\/span><\/a>, I have not been able to get a response from anyone at the resort in the past couple of weeks. I understand that their response my be slow since their still preparing for their opening but I'm getting nervous as well. Who were working with to secure your date?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409091107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.19.137","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1412807191,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"48f2d6c9e8fbebc0241e99e63985c759","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi ladies\n\n\nI got my rate for 100 per night. A lot of the rate has to do on the timing of your wedding. Jan to April is considered high season and in high demand so prices are double. 2nd week of april after easter prices drop in half and the closer to rainy season the cheaper it gets. I was looking over the price list for dreams riviera cancun just to get some sort of idea how much things will cost and I saw that the dj package is 1500!!! I think it will be cheaper to fly in our own dj and split the cost by 3 brides that are getting married close together. I know some amazing ny djs and I offer them a free trip to costa rica in exchange to 4 to 5 hrs of djing at wedding I think they will go for it.\n\n\nAlso I was looking to hire a local planner that can negotiate prices with the hotel and bring in cheaper vendors would anyone be interested in that? Maybe we can get a special rate if a lot of us use same company.\n\n@[member=\"puravida2015\"] @ projectwayne2015\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872415,"PostDate":1411219706,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies<br><br>\nI got my rate for 100 per night. A lot of the rate has to do on the timing of your wedding. Jan to April is considered high season and in high demand so prices are double. 2nd week of april after easter prices drop in half and the closer to rainy season the cheaper it gets. I was looking over the price list for dreams riviera cancun just to get some sort of idea how much things will cost and I saw that the dj package is 1500!!! I think it will be cheaper to fly in our own dj and split the cost by 3 brides that are getting married close together. I know some amazing ny djs and I offer them a free trip to costa rica in exchange to 4 to 5 hrs of djing at wedding I think they will go for it.<br><br>\nAlso I was looking to hire a local planner that can negotiate prices with the hotel and bring in cheaper vendors would anyone be interested in that? Maybe we can get a special rate if a lot of us use same company.<br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279580\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279580-puravida2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">puravida2015<\/span><\/a> @ projectwayne2015<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lanaaksman@aol.com","IpAddress":"108.29.94.73","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407510928,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Laks86","Id":279365,"Name":"Laks86","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.227.239.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1412807159,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ae23714462ea8fb85f43af50c95a5261","RawContent":"@[member=\"Laks86\"] - I already booked my dj and photographer and I believe that @[member=\"projecttwayne2015\"] at least booked her photographer as well. she was looking at dj&#039;s last i spoke with her. We also talked about decor options offered by the resort so I would be open to looking other decor options as well. I&#039;ll see if I can find your group on FB. Thank you\n[quote name=\"Laks86\" post=\"1872415\" timestamp=\"1411219706\"]\nHi ladies\n\nI got my rate for 100 per night. A lot of the rate has to do on the timing of your wedding. Jan to April is considered high season and in high demand so prices are double. 2nd week of april after easter prices drop in half and the closer to rainy season the cheaper it gets. I was looking over the price list for dreams riviera cancun just to get some sort of idea how much things will cost and I saw that the dj package is 1500!!! I think it will be cheaper to fly in our own dj and split the cost by 3 brides that are getting married close together. I know some amazing ny djs and I offer them a free trip to costa rica in exchange to 4 to 5 hrs of djing at wedding I think they will go for it.\n\nAlso I was looking to hire a local planner that can negotiate prices with the hotel and bring in cheaper vendors would anyone be interested in that? Maybe we can get a special rate if a lot of us use same company.\n@[member=\"puravida2015\"] @ projectwayne2015\n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1872418,"PostDate":1411222594,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279365\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279365-laks86\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Laks86<\/span><\/a> - I already booked my dj and photographer and I believe that @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279107\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279107-projecttwayne2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">projecttwayne2015<\/span><\/a> at least booked her photographer as well. she was looking at dj's last i spoke with her. We also talked about decor options offered by the resort so I would be open to looking other decor options as well. I'll see if I can find your group on FB. Thank you<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Laks86, on 20 September 2014 - 05:28 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi ladies<br><br>\nI got my rate for 100 per night. A lot of the rate has to do on the timing of your wedding. Jan to April is considered high season and in high demand so prices are double. 2nd week of april after easter prices drop in half and the closer to rainy season the cheaper it gets. I was looking over the price list for dreams riviera cancun just to get some sort of idea how much things will cost and I saw that the dj package is 1500!!! I think it will be cheaper to fly in our own dj and split the cost by 3 brides that are getting married close together. I know some amazing ny djs and I offer them a free trip to costa rica in exchange to 4 to 5 hrs of djing at wedding I think they will go for it.<br><br>\nAlso I was looking to hire a local planner that can negotiate prices with the hotel and bring in cheaper vendors would anyone be interested in that? Maybe we can get a special rate if a lot of us use same company.<br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279580\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279580-puravida2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">puravida2015<\/span><\/a> @ projectwayne2015<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409091107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.211.82.43","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b56c973b2ddc9ffc486d11721a065d28","RawContent":"Hi ladies,\n\n\n@[member=\"Laks86\"] I did hire a photographer and in conversations with two DJS.  We will definately need a DJ for a party so if you can come up with something Laks, that could work for me. The only thing I am concerned about are the vendor fees. When I spoke with Rocio she said she is not sure yet but vendor fees can be up to 500 per vendor. I mean that&#039;s ridiculous!!! Since the resort hasn&#039;t been in contact with me I am going to find my own vendors and then resolve this issue about the vendor fees. I found this awesome florist however they are quite slow in responding. I haven&#039;t harassed them in a while because I&#039;ve been trying to finish my project at work. I can send you their packages and pricing and we can try and negotiate something as a three bee special. \nOh...one thing i did find out was that the food cost will be 75.00 per person for adults and 45.00 for children for those that took the ultimate package. I wish i had known that sooner but guess it&#039;s too late now. Lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1872420,"PostDate":1411223493,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies,<br><br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279365\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279365-laks86\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Laks86<\/span><\/a> I did hire a photographer and in conversations with two DJS.  We will definately need a DJ for a party so if you can come up with something Laks, that could work for me. The only thing I am concerned about are the vendor fees. When I spoke with Rocio she said she is not sure yet but vendor fees can be up to 500 per vendor. I mean that's ridiculous!!! Since the resort hasn't been in contact with me I am going to find my own vendors and then resolve this issue about the vendor fees. I found this awesome florist however they are quite slow in responding. I haven't harassed them in a while because I've been trying to finish my project at work. I can send you their packages and pricing and we can try and negotiate something as a three bee special. <br \/>Oh...one thing i did find out was that the food cost will be 75.00 per person for adults and 45.00 for children for those that took the ultimate package. I wish i had known that sooner but guess it's too late now. Lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tammy.jacobs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.211.99.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405957765,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279107.jpg?_r=1408932832","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"projecttwayne2015","Id":279107,"Name":"projecttwayne2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":65,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
