Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.227.239.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c439fe6f1877764eb02a0c8447b4a14c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think the good thing about @[member=\"Laks86\"] plan is that if the \"vendor\" is staying at the resort the vendor fee doesn&#039;t apply. The question would be how would they get their dj equipment there or would you just plan on renting from the resort?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"projecttwayne2015\"] - I still didn&#039;t hear back from Rocio or Alejandro. ughhh I think I might just have to let you talk to them for me. They seem to respond to you! :) Yes, let me know about the florist. I want to keep that simple but I&#039;m open to other options. &amp;nbsp;I figured the food would be around that much. Thankfully I&#039;m not as far over as you. Did they provide you with the food options yet or just the price?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872421,"PostDate":1411224020,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think the good thing about @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279365\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279365-laks86\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Laks86<\/span><\/a> plan is that if the \"vendor\" is staying at the resort the vendor fee doesn't apply. The question would be how would they get their dj equipment there or would you just plan on renting from the resort?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279107\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279107-projecttwayne2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">projecttwayne2015<\/span><\/a> - I still didn't hear back from Rocio or Alejandro. ughhh I think I might just have to let you talk to them for me. They seem to respond to you! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Yes, let me know about the florist. I want to keep that simple but I'm open to other options. \u00a0I figured the food would be around that much. Thankfully I'm not as far over as you. Did they provide you with the food options yet or just the price?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409091107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.19.137","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"99d4a11a5439a0065e2e632cefd231c9","RawContent":"Who are you guys using for photos and dj? Can we start an email chain  or some sort of chat? Can can save so much money if we do this all together. I booked a trip to the resort for dec to sit down with them. I hope to see some weddings while I am there as well that&#039;s why I am a little hesitant on booking anything at the moment without seeing their options\n@ projectwayne2015 @[member=\"puravida2015\"] can we set up a call with the 3 of us? Dj would bring own equipment I would think it depends. There will be weddings in nov and dec so I would think they have more info then they are giving us.","Attachments":[],"Id":1872425,"PostDate":1411226763,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Who are you guys using for photos and dj? Can we start an email chain  or some sort of chat? Can can save so much money if we do this all together. I booked a trip to the resort for dec to sit down with them. I hope to see some weddings while I am there as well that's why I am a little hesitant on booking anything at the moment without seeing their options<br \/>@ projectwayne2015 @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279580\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279580-puravida2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">puravida2015<\/span><\/a> can we set up a call with the 3 of us? Dj would bring own equipment I would think it depends. There will be weddings in nov and dec so I would think they have more info then they are giving us.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lanaaksman@aol.com","IpAddress":"108.29.94.73","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407510928,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Laks86","Id":279365,"Name":"Laks86","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.23.193.191","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95d67a07e40013a415ced456e04a4b05","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"projecttwayne2015\"] can you please send the information that they sent you? &amp;nbsp;My friend is getting married the following weekend and I&#039;m helping to plan her wedding. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m looking for the pricing for everything for the so-called \"extras.\"&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you so much!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874401,"PostDate":1412569517,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279107\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279107-projecttwayne2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">projecttwayne2015<\/span><\/a> can you please send the information that they sent you? \u00a0My friend is getting married the following weekend and I'm helping to plan her wedding. \u00a0I'm looking for the pricing for everything for the so-called \"extras.\"<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you so much!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"devorah.brumberger@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.23.193.191","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412569358,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"phoebs610","Id":280305,"Name":"phoebs610","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"141.155.175.28","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bad8784939ea3b10fc22187963219252","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;anyone have any updates?&amp;nbsp; The resort is opening soon... hopefully new info will be available soon!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I cant even print up invitations yet :(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876198,"PostDate":1413745112,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>anyone have any updates?\u00a0 The resort is opening soon... hopefully new info will be available soon!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I cant even print up invitations yet <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"idawhite@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.167.189.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407500627,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279359.jpg?_r=1407595489","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":163,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bkprettygirl","Id":279359,"Name":"bkprettygirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.81.133.248","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"52231aa53c1dc9beee8b8c18e2b7c68b","RawContent":"They haven&#039;t posted much. They have a wedding manager now. The posted a number but it doesn&#039;t seem correct. There are links to menus when accessing the site through mobile but I&#039;m not sure they&#039;re the actual menus. The seem to be the same ones from another site. Hoping to get some more info this week. \n\n[quote name=\"bkprettygirl\" post=\"1876198\" timestamp=\"1413745112\"]\nanyone have any updates?  The resort is opening soon... hopefully new info will be available soon!\n \nI cant even print up invitations yet :([\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1876222,"PostDate":1413752846,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                They haven't posted much. They have a wedding manager now. The posted a number but it doesn't seem correct. There are links to menus when accessing the site through mobile but I'm not sure they're the actual menus. The seem to be the same ones from another site. Hoping to get some more info this week. <br><br><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>bkprettygirl, on 19 October 2014 - 10:58 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>anyone have any updates?\u00a0 The resort is opening soon... hopefully new info will be available soon!<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI cant even print up invitations yet <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409091107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.35.40.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7f2695758c05a518d3735317073a90a7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I feel like I should follow this thread. My travel agent recommended Dreams (and the Westin and Rui), so reading about it here, and another thread (though can&#039;t seem to find it), but I&#039;m nervous for the resort&#039;s lack of communication.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876323,"PostDate":1413850519,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I feel like I should follow this thread. My travel agent recommended Dreams (and the Westin and Rui), so reading about it here, and another thread (though can't seem to find it), but I'm nervous for the resort's lack of communication.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wonderlandgrl3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.99.50.82","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407874186,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279411.jpg?_r=1408152053","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mangosong","Id":279411,"Name":"Mangosong","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.227.239.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"85f98c69cd58eb3c1227922fb3537cd2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;You have to keep in mind that Dreams hasn&#039;t even opened yet. Yes, communication has been spotty but that&#039;s something that I can somewhat understand. A lot of their focus is on their grand opening and immediate weddings. They just got a onsite wedding manager and she has been fairly responsive. They also recently posted a direct number.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876631,"PostDate":1414013155,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>You have to keep in mind that Dreams hasn't even opened yet. Yes, communication has been spotty but that's something that I can somewhat understand. A lot of their focus is on their grand opening and immediate weddings. They just got a onsite wedding manager and she has been fairly responsive. They also recently posted a direct number.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409091107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"141.155.175.28","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53c59ce188cb84b66621fb583342171f","RawContent":"That number doesnt work\n\nI havent heard back from the new coordinator yet...\n\nBut still, I understand since resort hasnt opened yet\n\n[quote name=\"puravida2015\" post=\"1876631\" timestamp=\"1414013155\"]\nYou have to keep in mind that Dreams hasn&#039;t even opened yet. Yes, communication has been spotty but that&#039;s something that I can somewhat understand. A lot of their focus is on their grand opening and immediate weddings. They just got a onsite wedding manager and she has been fairly responsive. They also recently posted a direct number.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1876633,"PostDate":1414014037,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>That number doesnt work<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I havent heard back from the new coordinator yet...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>But still, I understand since resort hasnt opened yet<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>puravida2015, on 22 October 2014 - 01:25 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>You have to keep in mind that Dreams hasn't even opened yet. Yes, communication has been spotty but that's something that I can somewhat understand. A lot of their focus is on their grand opening and immediate weddings. They just got a onsite wedding manager and she has been fairly responsive. They also recently posted a direct number.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"idawhite@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.167.189.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407500627,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279359.jpg?_r=1407595489","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":163,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bkprettygirl","Id":279359,"Name":"bkprettygirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.227.239.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b9bfb133eb8d4a58d29e2e3f2271a8e","RawContent":"I honestly haven&#039;t tried the number yet but just saw they posted it. Bummer! Does it give a message or anything?  You emailed Connie? She&#039;s been pretty responsive with me and my TA. Roscio replied JUST replied to my email from over a month ago but never even answered my question.\n[quote name=\"bkprettygirl\" post=\"1876633\" timestamp=\"1414014037\"]\nThat number doesnt work\n\nI havent heard back from the new coordinator yet...\n\nBut still, I understand since resort hasnt opened yet[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1876636,"PostDate":1414014665,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I honestly haven't tried the number yet but just saw they posted it. Bummer! Does it give a message or anything?\u00a0 You emailed Connie? She's been pretty responsive with me and my TA. Roscio replied JUST replied to my email from over a month ago but never even answered my question.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>bkprettygirl, on 22 October 2014 - 01:40 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>That number doesnt work<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I havent heard back from the new coordinator yet...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>But still, I understand since resort hasnt opened yet<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409091107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"141.155.175.28","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77599,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7f7665fc5c5fd27042b20e387d3aae0","RawContent":"yep.. I emailed Connie two days ago... no response...\n\nabout how long does she take to reply?\n\nThey still havent taken my deposit (daniel said they would when the resort opens) \n\n[quote name=\"puravida2015\" post=\"1876636\" timestamp=\"1414014665\"]\nI honestly haven&#039;t tried the number yet but just saw they posted it. Bummer! Does it give a message or anything?  You emailed Connie? She&#039;s been pretty responsive with me and my TA. Roscio replied JUST replied to my email from over a month ago but never even answered my question.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1876640,"PostDate":1414015070,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>yep.. I emailed Connie two days ago... no response...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>about how long does she take to reply?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They still havent taken my deposit (daniel said they would when the resort opens)\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>puravida2015, on 22 October 2014 - 01:51 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I honestly haven't tried the number yet but just saw they posted it. Bummer! Does it give a message or anything?\u00a0 You emailed Connie? She's been pretty responsive with me and my TA. Roscio replied JUST replied to my email from over a month ago but never even answered my question.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"idawhite@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.167.189.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407500627,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279359.jpg?_r=1407595489","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":163,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bkprettygirl","Id":279359,"Name":"bkprettygirl","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":65,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
